---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const UPDATED = '20 August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — TextWonder"
  description="The terms for using TextWonder's free browser-based tools: what you may do with them, what we promise, what we don't, and where liability ends. Plain English, no signup required."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: {UPDATED}</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Agreement</h2>
        <p>
          These terms govern your use of textwonder.com and every tool, page and article on it
          (together, "the Service"). By using the Service you accept them. If you do not, please
          stop using the site.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          There is no account to create and nothing to sign. Using a tool is the agreement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">What the Service is</h2>
        <p>
          TextWonder is a collection of free utilities — text, PDF, image, developer, calculator,
          health, student, colour, data and unit tools — that run as JavaScript inside your own
          browser. Nothing you process is uploaded to us. There is no server-side processing, no
          storage of your files, and no queue your work sits in.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Because of that architecture, a few ordinary consequences follow: the tools depend on
          your device's memory and speed, very large files may fail on modest hardware, and
          results are not recoverable once you close the tab. Nothing is saved for you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You may use TextWonder for personal, educational, and commercial work, free of charge. You may not:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 mt-3 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li>Use the Service to process content you have no legal right to process — for example, documents you obtained unlawfully.</li>
          <li>Use it to produce material that is unlawful, defamatory, or infringes someone else's intellectual property.</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt the site, probe it for vulnerabilities without permission, or interfere with other people's use of it.</li>
          <li>Scrape, mirror or automatically re-host the site's pages in bulk, or present its content as your own.</li>
          <li>Interfere with the advertising that funds the site, or generate invalid ad traffic of any kind.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Your content stays yours</h2>
        <p>
          You keep every right in whatever you put through a tool. We claim no licence over it,
          because we never receive it in the first place — see the
          <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 underline">Privacy Policy</a>
          for how that works.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Output produced by a tool is yours to use as you wish, including commercially.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Our content</h2>
        <p>
          The site's design, written guides, tool copy and code are owned by TextWonder and
          protected by copyright. You are welcome to link to any page and to quote from an article
          with attribution. Republishing whole pages, or reproducing the tool suite as a
          competing site, is not permitted.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Third-party libraries used by the tools — such as <code class="text-violet-400">pdf-lib</code>
          and <code class="text-violet-400">PDF.js</code> — remain under their own open-source licences.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">No warranty</h2>
        <p>
          The Service is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranty of any kind, express
          or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and
          non-infringement.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not warrant that a tool will be error-free, that results will be accurate for your
          particular case, or that the site will be uninterrupted. Calculators and converters are
          built carefully and tested, but they are informational aids — check anything that
          matters before you rely on it. See the
          <a href="/disclaimer/" class="text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 underline">Disclaimer</a>,
          which matters especially for the financial, health and academic tools.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <strong class="text-white">Keep your originals.</strong> Before using a tool that
          modifies a file, keep a copy. Browser-based processing can fail on an unusual file or a
          low-memory device, and we cannot recover anything for you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, TextWonder and its operator are not liable for
          any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages, or for any loss of
          data, profits, or business, arising from your use of or inability to use the Service.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Since the Service is free, our total aggregate liability for any claim relating to it is
          limited to zero. Some jurisdictions do not allow certain exclusions, so parts of this
          section may not apply to you; nothing here limits liability that cannot lawfully be
          limited.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Advertising and third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          The site displays advertising through Google AdSense, which is what keeps every tool
          free. Ads are selected by Google, not by us, and their appearance here is not an
          endorsement.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Articles sometimes link to external sites. We do not control those sites and are not
          responsible for their content, accuracy or privacy practices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Availability and changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may add, change, or remove tools and pages at any time, and may suspend the site for
          maintenance without notice. We may update these terms; the date at the top of this page
          reflects the current version, and continuing to use the site after a change means you
          accept it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of India, and the courts of India have jurisdiction
          over any dispute arising from them — without affecting any mandatory consumer protection
          rights you have where you live.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms: <span class="text-violet-400">aayushman6139@gmail.com</span>,
          or via the
          <a href="/contact/" class="text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 underline">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <p class="text-sm">
          See also:
          <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 underline">Privacy Policy</a> ·
          <a href="/cookie-policy/" class="text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 underline">Cookie Policy</a> ·
          <a href="/disclaimer/" class="text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 underline">Disclaimer</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
